Amasty is a popular extension provider for the Magento ecosystem. The company offers a huge list of all possible tools with the Magento 2 gift card extension among them. The tool provides store visitors with the ability to purchase gift cards and send them to friends by both email or post. Note that an unlimited number of gift cards is supported. Besides, several pricing models are offered, so you can provide extremely flexible shopping conditions. And as a Magento owner, you can keep track of all sold certificates. Check the following features for the better understanding of what is possible with this Magento 2 gift card extension:
- Gift cards with
- fixed price;
- open price;
- User-friendly gift code generation;
- Online and offline gift cards;
- Gift card templates.
